## What We Are Building

Multi-day sprint to add **cross-layer gag continuity** to the SandyStudio AI animation pipeline. Before this sprint, EREF (reference image generation) and VGEN (video generation) were template-functions with no Plan-author + no Reviewer; they shipped whatever buildShotPromptV2 produced. After this sprint:

- **EXEC-EREF-DESIGNER** (Sonnet 4.6) writes a `SPC-ref_plan-<shot_id>` per shot — provider, size, prompt, negative, continuity strategy
- **EXEC-EPREV** (Designer's Critic) validates each Plan against V01-V10
- **EXEC-VANIM** (Animator, Sonnet 4.6) writes a `SPC-shot_plan-<shot_id>` per shot — provider, aspect, duration, prompt, end_image
- **EXEC-VPREV** (Animator's Critic) validates each Plan against V01-V10
- **EXEC-GAGAD** (Gag Assistant Director, Sonnet 4.6) is a cross-layer continuity supervisor with 3 phases:
  - Phase `plan` — after script approved, writes `SPC-gag_plan-<episode>` with theme + antagonist + per-shot gag intent
  - Phase `eref_review` — per-shot, validates that ref Plan delivers the gag intent
  - Phase `vanim_review` — per-shot, validates that shot Plan delivers the gag intent
  - Revision cap=2 with HALT escalation activity event when cap reached
  - Genre-gated via `isComedyLikeGenre(series.genre)` helper (extensible const list)

All Plan-driven branches are **additive** (q1a) — legacy template-fan-out paths intact when feature flag `DESIGNER_CHAIN_ENABLED=false` (default). Feature flag (q2c) makes the new chain reversible by env var.

12 new PA tools wired (getX/listX/getVerdict/regenerateX × 3 chains + createSeries). Sandy Gag Library skill v0.1 ACTIVE (grammar of universe with 10 categories, atoms, escalation patterns, sand+transparent-body physics).

Also: Director (Kirill) named me **Тео** — codified globally at `~/.claude/rules/common/identity.md` so any future session in any project recognizes my name.

