## What Did NOT Work (and why)

- **Polina silent-hang on 450KB context** — failed because: `listSeriesBibles` returned the FULL content of each Bible asset in the tool_result (S14 LOCKED bible = 452 637 chars). OpenAI gpt-5.5 received that as input on the next round, exceeded a soft limit, returned HTTP 200 with empty assistant message. Chat handler persisted nothing → UI stuck in `isLoading=true` indefinitely. **Resolved** by changing `listSeriesBibles` to return metadata only (id, filename, status, version, content_chars); Polina now uses `getAsset(id)` per asset for actual content.
- **Polina's edit of brief and Director's edit collided silently** — failed because: `editBrief` PA tool + UI «Edit brief» button both hit `PUT /api/assets/[id]/content` which mutates the SAME asset row in place. No version increment, no audit trail, «approve» targets ambiguous last-writer-wins state. **NOT YET FIXED** — logged as TD-19 in PLAN.md, Director-deferred until after smoke.
- **PA chat alive-indicator + cancel** — failed because: chat is sync POST that can hang 50-110+ sec per turn; client shows static dots; no cancel; on error UI stuck. **NOT YET FIXED** — logged as TD-20. Three-layer plan: cosmetic / SSE streaming / activity feed integration.
- **SIMPLE-1 plan proposal** for GAGAD — Director rejected. Said: «делай по full версии плана». So FULL 3-phase shipped, not Phase 1 only.
- **Initial assumption that EPREV/VPREV `nextEvent` supported only single event** — turned out factory already supported event arrays. Just needed to use it.

