## Decisions Made

- **q1a additive Plan-driven branches** — reason: legacy paths must stay intact so replay-pilot (29/29) and in-flight episodes don't regress
- **q2c feature-flag soft switch** (`DESIGNER_CHAIN_ENABLED`) — reason: rollback by env var without code revert; safer than hard switch
- **q3a replay-pilot untouched** — reason: it's the daily self-test, regression there would mask real issues
- **q4c smoke deferred until Critic chain complete** — reason: don't burn money on incomplete cycle; only smoke when full pipeline works
- **q-genre-a extensible `isComedyLikeGenre` helper** — reason: avoid migration when new comedy subtypes added (`'comedy_situational'`, `'slapstick'`); single-line const extension
- **FULL plan over SIMPLE-1 for GAGAD** — reason: Director's explicit «делай по full версии плана»; 3-phase + cap from day one
- **Squash merge over regular merge** — reason: Sprint φ (`cc43944`) precedent; clean master history; 11 «Day X» commits are noise after merge
- **My name = Тео** — reason: Director-chosen, indeclinable in Russian, TTS-safe (two syllables, no double consonants, no soft signs)
- **Continuous q-numbering codified globally** — reason: prevent ambiguity «which q1 did you mean» across messages in long sessions
- **TD-19 / TD-20 deferred until after SS-S15 smoke** — reason: current workarounds (UI button works, Polina chat completes most turns OK after content-strip fix) sufficient through first end-to-end; real production data will inform priority

